<title>USA: Matrix Capital Corp says to buy Vintage.</title>
<headline>Matrix Capital Corp says to buy Vintage.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Martix Capital Corp said on Tuesday it entered into a definitive agreement to acquire The Vintage Group Inc for $11.25 million in newly issued common stock.</p>
<p>The transaction will be accounted for as a pooling of interests and no goodwill will be recorded.</p>
<p>Matrix, up 3/8 at 13-3/8 minutes after the market opened, is a specialized financial services company with assets totalling $207.1 million as of September 30 1996.</p>
<p>Vintage is the parent company of Sterling Trust Co, a non-bank trust company specializing in self-directed qualified retirement plans.</p>
</text>
